{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEXT STOP: BEATTOWN!</strong> Get off the bus and step into BeatTown, the town where you grew up. You are a pro wrestler who is taking a break from his career, only to return home and find it in complete disarray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FISHERMAN NEEDS HELP!</strong> Each villager has some problem that has manifested out of nowhere. The game's first level is to help Gus the Fisherman catch fish. Once you've done that, you can help him catch more in the 'Endless' mode, where you try to catch as many fish as possible before getting knocked out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME TO THROW DOWN!</strong> Use your wrestling skills to solve BeatTown\u2019s problems. Punch the goons that are messing with the power grid. Push the fish onto the hook. Swing the beavers away from the lumber pile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BeatTown allows you to live out your wrestling dreams by beating up on anthropomorphized creatures. So come on over and give them the beatdown in <strong>BEATTOWN.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Version - 1.0: Launches with our first level, Fisherman, in both it's story and endless versions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next Version - 1.1 &quot;Town Update&quot;: Launches with our walkable town where you accept the quest from the fisherman and can explore the town you will be saving.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593370?t=1747402079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593370?t=1747402079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593370/303cc0759087c47e2bb32d468f0888d653ccde07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747402079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593370/303cc0759087c47e2bb32d468f0888d653ccde07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747402079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEXT STOP: BEATTOWN!</strong> Get off the bus and step into BeatTown, the town where you grew up. You are a pro wrestler who is taking a break from his career, only to return home and find it in complete disarray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FISHERMAN NEEDS HELP!</strong> Each villager has some problem that has manifested out of nowhere. The game's first level is to help Gus the Fisherman catch fish. Once you've done that, you can help him catch more in the 'Endless' mode, where you try to catch as many fish as possible before getting knocked out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME TO THROW DOWN!</strong> Use your wrestling skills to solve BeatTown\u2019s problems. Punch the goons that are messing with the power grid. Push the fish onto the hook. Swing the beavers away from the lumber pile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BeatTown allows you to live out your wrestling dreams by beating up on anthropomorphized creatures. So come on over and give them the beatdown in <strong>BEATTOWN.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Version - 1.0: Launches with our first level, Fisherman, in both it's story and endless versions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next Version - 1.1 &quot;Town Update&quot;: Launches with our walkable town where you accept the quest from the fisherman and can explore the town you will be saving.</p>","developers":["Kiwi Punch LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st